{"kind":"artifact","text":"Merged at 4f8d06a0: the workroom UI at ui. A mounted-render test now covers the work drawer's wiring to browser storage — the load in the mount effect and the save in the follow handler — which static rendering cannot see and which could previously be cut in either direction with the suite green. The test seeds a Map-backed storage shim before the drawer mounts and clicks follow after it, reusing the jsdom, React act and Vite patterns the suite already had; production code is unchanged. Severing the load fails it on the followed topic; severing the save fails it on the stored value. The reviewer reproduced both severances independently.","body":{"commit":"4f8d06a087586191fcba54c40ccf4235be0bb424","path":"ui"}}